{# Visual Demo Grid #}
<section class="ss-c-demo__section">
    <h2>Visual Spacing Reference</h2>

    <p>See how Q values translate to actual spacing:</p>

    <div style="margin: calc(var(--grid-unit) * 3) 0;">
        <div style="margin-bottom: calc(var(--grid-unit) * 3);">
            <div
                style="font-family: var(--ss-font-family-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color_text_tertiary); margin-bottom: calc(var(--grid-unit) * 1);">
                q(4) (Micro)</div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: calc(var(--grid-unit) * 1);">
                <div style="background: var(--color_text_primary); height: 32px; width: 16px; border-radius: 2px;"></div>
                <span
                    style="font-family: var(--ss-font-family-mono); font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--color_text_tertiary);">16px</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: calc(var(--grid-unit) * 3);">
            <div
                style="font-family: var(--ss-font-family-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color_text_tertiary); margin-bottom: calc(var(--grid-unit) * 1);">
